---
description: Investigate one chosen specialist's actual current identity, retained assignment and original result.
budget: { maxTurns: 32 }
args:
  goal: string
  index: SpecialistIndex
  choice: SpecialistChoice
returns: SpecialistEvidence
---
Investigate what the selected owned specialist's current native evidence supports. The inspect-only membership boundary binds the exact context, channel and selected handle without changing membership. Read the owned retained run and use the receipt branch to distinguish active, cancelled, failed, foreign, stale and settled original work. Refresh when current evidence or an unavailable readback calls for it; do not invent evidence or treat an earlier success as the latest assignment.

Read an original artifact only for the matching verified result, through the scoped native workspace API. Keep provider, participant, task, revision, source event and original bytes distinct from a display handle or child summary. Return bound actual evidence, including a genuine absence or uncertainty, for the parent to decide further work. The binder can join semantic selections to exact observed records without copying identifiers by hand. Do not stage, send, replace a worker or change parent source in this investigation.
